C ELM6                UPDATE
C
C AP        APERTURE.
C CAP       TRUE IF 13. 10. IS PRESENT.
C JA        SECOND ITEM ON AN UPDATE CARD (ALWAYS ZERO).
C KA        INDICATES WHICH TRANSFER MATRIX IS UPDATED
C
      LOGICAL         CAP
      INTEGER         JA, KA
      REAL            AP
C
      COMMON /ELM6/   AP, CAP, JA, KA
